@startuml User Login Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title User Login Use Case\n(התחברות משתמש)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Login Page\n(דף התחברות)" as LoginPage
participant "Auth Reducer\n(Redux)" as AuthReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Customer Auth Controller" as AuthController
participant "Customer Model\n(MongoDB)" as CustomerModel
participant "JWT Token Creator" as TokenCreator

User -> LoginPage: Enter email and password\n(הזנת אימייל וסיסמה)
activate LoginPage

LoginPage -> LoginPage: Validate form data\n(בדיקת תקינות נתונים)

LoginPage -> AuthReducer: dispatch(customer_login({email, password}))
activate AuthReducer

AuthReducer -> API: POST /api/customer/login
activate API

API -> AuthController: customer_login(req, res)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthController: Validate required fields\n(בדיקת שדות חובה)

AuthController -> CustomerModel: findOne({email}).select('+password')
activate CustomerModel
CustomerModel --> AuthController: Customer data with password\n(נתוני לקוח עם סיסמה)
deactivate CustomerModel

alt Customer not found
    AuthController --> API: 404 - Email not found
    API --> AuthReducer: Error response
    AuthReducer --> LoginPage: Show error message
    LoginPage --> User: Display "Email not found"\n(הצגת "אימייל לא נמצא")
else Customer found
    AuthController -> AuthController: bcrypt.compare(password, hashedPassword)\n(השוואת סיסמאות)
    
    alt Password incorrect
        AuthController --> API: 401 - Incorrect password
        API --> AuthReducer: Error response
        AuthReducer --> LoginPage: Show error message
        LoginPage --> User: Display "Incorrect password"\n(הצגת "סיסמה שגויה")
    else Password correct
        AuthController -> TokenCreator: createToken({id, name, email, role: 'customer'})
        activate TokenCreator
        TokenCreator --> AuthController: JWT Token
        deactivate TokenCreator
        
        AuthController -> AuthController: Set HTTP-only cookie\n(הגדרת עוגיה מאובטחת)
        
        AuthController --> API: 200 - Login successful + token
        deactivate AuthController
        
        API --> AuthReducer: Success response with token
        deactivate API
        
        AuthReducer -> AuthReducer: Store token in localStorage\n(שמירת טוקן במחסן מקומי)
        
        AuthReducer --> LoginPage: Login successful
        deactivate AuthReducer
        
        LoginPage --> User: Redirect to dashboard/home\n(הפניה לדף הבית)
    end
end

deactivate LoginPage

note right of AuthController
  Authentication uses bcrypt
  to compare plain password
  with hashed password
  (אימות באמצעות bcrypt)
end note

note right of TokenCreator
  JWT token contains:
  - Customer ID
  - Name, Email, Method
  - Role: 'customer'
  - Expires in 7 days
end note

@enduml
